slug: "blacklist-and-appeals"
title: "Blacklists and Appeals"
category: "moderation"
excerpt: "What happens when a server is blacklisted from Niko, what stays saved, and how an appeal gives it back."
tags: ["blacklist","appeal","moderation","starboard","polls","giveaways","notifications"]
order: 4
